# commands - paste
schematica.command.paste.usage=/schematicaPaste <x> <y> <z> <name> [force], or /schematicaPaste undo
schematica.command.paste.directoryUnavailable=Could not find your schematic directory on the server.
schematica.command.paste.notFound=Schematic "%s" could not be found.
schematica.command.paste.readFailed=Could not read %s. The server log has the details.
schematica.command.paste.unsupportedFormat=%s is not an Alpha schematic, so it cannot be pasted.
schematica.command.paste.empty=%s has no blocks to paste (size %d x %d x %d).
schematica.command.paste.tooLarge=%s is %d blocks, more than the paste limit of %d (pasteVolumeLimit in the Schematica config).
schematica.command.paste.outOfHeight=The paste would span y %d to %d, which is outside 0 to 255.
schematica.command.paste.notLoaded=Part of the target area is not loaded. Stand closer to it and try again.
schematica.command.paste.unknownBlocks=Nothing was pasted: this game has no block for %s.
schematica.command.paste.machinesWithoutData=Nothing was pasted: %d GregTech machine blocks have no tile entity data in the file (the first at %s), so they would load as broken machines.
schematica.command.paste.notEmpty=Nothing was pasted: %d blocks are in the way (the first at %s). Add force to replace them.
schematica.command.paste.pasted=Pasted %s at %d %d %d: %d blocks and %d tile entities.
schematica.command.paste.warnings=%d warnings, all in the server log. The first: %s
schematica.command.paste.nothingToUndo=You have no paste to undo.
schematica.command.paste.undoNotLoaded=The area of your last paste is not loaded. Go back to it and try again.
schematica.command.paste.undone=Cleared your last paste (%d x %d x %d) back to air. Blocks it replaced are not restored.

# commands - paste here
schematica.command.pasteHere.usage=/schematicaPasteHere [force]
schematica.command.pasteHere.noSchematic=No schematic is loaded.
schematica.command.pasteHere.transformed=The loaded schematic is rotated or flipped, and a paste writes the file as it was saved. Rotate and flip it back first.
schematica.command.pasteHere.noPath=The loaded schematic's file is not known. Load it again from the load screen.
schematica.command.pasteHere.unsendablePath=The path %s cannot go through chat unchanged (it has double spaces, special characters, or "force" as its last word). Rename the file.
schematica.command.pasteHere.tooLong=The paste command would be %d characters, over the chat limit of %d. Move the file to a shorter path.
